# Build and CI

## Configure / build

```bash
# macOS (LLVM 21 via Homebrew)
SDKROOT=$(xcrun --show-sdk-path) cmake --preset default
cmake --build build

# Linux / Cursor Cloud (LLVM 15)
cmake --preset linux-llvm15
cmake --build build -j$(nproc)
```

LLVM paths:

- macOS: `/opt/homebrew/opt/llvm@21/bin/` (adjust version as needed)
- Linux cloud image: `/usr/lib/llvm-15/` (`clang-format-15`, `clang-tidy-15`)

Do not use `cmake --preset default` on the cloud LLVM 15 image — `default` targets LLVM 21 on Linux.

## Tests

```bash
bash tests/run_lit_tests.sh
```

## CI debug

```bash
gh run list --limit 1
gh run watch <ID> --exit-status
gh run view <ID> --log-failed
```
